    },
    {
      "name": "Risk Score",
      "description": "Endpoints de consulta e cálculo de scores de risco-país com base em indicadores do World Bank.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Risk Score (BR)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/risk-score?country_code=BR",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "risk-score"],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "country_code",
                  "value": "BR",
                  "description": "Código ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 do país"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Retorna o score de risco para o Brasil (BR). Troque o valor de `country_code` para consultar outros países (ex.: US, DE, AR, MX).\n\n**Tiers:**\n- low: score < 50, sem ajuste\n- medium: score 50–74, +3%\n- high: score >= 75, +8%"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Brasil",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/risk-score?country_code=BR",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "risk-score"],
                  "query": [
                    { "key": "country_code", "value": "BR" }
                  ]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n  \"riskScore\": 62,\n  \"tier\": \"medium\",\n  \"sourceAttribution\": \"World Bank (CC BY 4.0)\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Batch Risk Score",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"country_codes\": [\"BR\", \"US\", \"DE\"]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/risk-score/batch",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "risk-score", "batch"]
            },
            "description": "Processa uma lista de países em lote e retorna o score de risco para cada um. Ideal para avaliar múltiplos mercados de uma vez.\n\nAdicione ou remova códigos de país no array `country_codes` conforme necessário."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Lote BR, US, DE",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"country_codes\": [\"BR\", \"US\", \"DE\"]\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/risk-score/batch",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "risk-score", "batch"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n    \"riskScore\": 62,\n    \"tier\": \"medium\",\n    \"sourceAttribution\": \"World Bank (CC BY 4.0)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"countryCode\": \"US\",\n    \"riskScore\": 22,\n    \"tier\": \"low\",\n    \"sourceAttribution\": \"World Bank (CC BY 4.0)\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"countryCode\": \"DE\",\n    \"riskScore\": 18,\n    \"tier\": \"low\",\n    \"sourceAttribution\": \"World Bank (CC BY 4.0)\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pricing",
      "description": "Endpoints para geração de cotações e bandas de preço ajustadas ao risco-país.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Pricing Bands",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n      \"riskScore\": 62,\n      \"basePrice\": 1000\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/pricing/bands",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pricing", "bands"]
            },
            "description": "Calcula as bandas de pricing para uma lista de entradas. Cada entrada deve conter `countryCode`, `riskScore` e `basePrice`.\n\nO endpoint retorna o tier, multiplicador e preço final calculado para cada entrada, permitindo comparar múltiplos países/cenários de preço."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Bands para BR",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"entries\": [\n    {\n      \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n      \"riskScore\": 62,\n      \"basePrice\": 1000\n    }\n  ]\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/pricing/bands",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "pricing", "bands"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n    \"riskScore\": 62,\n    \"tier\": \"medium\",\n    \"basePrice\": 1000,\n    \"finalPrice\": 1030.0,\n    \"multiplier\": 1.03\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Pricing Quote",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n  \"riskScore\": 62,\n  \"basePrice\": 1000,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/pricing/quote",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "pricing", "quote"]
            },
            "description": "Gera uma cotação de preço completa para um país específico, aplicando o multiplicador de risco.\n\nRetorna todos os detalhes do cálculo para rastreabilidade: tier, ajuste percentual, multiplicador, preço base, preço final, moeda e timestamp.\n\n**Exemplos de cenários:**\n- BR (riskScore 62, medium): basePrice 1000 → finalPrice 1030\n- País high risk (riskScore 80): basePrice 1000 → finalPrice 1080\n- País low risk (riskScore 30): basePrice 1000 → finalPrice 1000"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK - Quote BR",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n  \"riskScore\": 62,\n  \"basePrice\": 1000,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/pricing/quote",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "pricing", "quote"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"BR\",\n  \"riskScore\": 62,\n  \"tier\": \"medium\",\n  \"adjustment\": 3,\n  \"multiplier\": 1.03,\n  \"basePrice\": 1000,\n  \"finalPrice\": 1030.0,\n  \"currency\": \"USD\",\n  \"generatedAtHttp\": \"Fri, 18 Apr 2026 00:00:00 GMT\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
